  "description": "👑 <strong>Great British Summer Savings applied to dates up until September 1st!</strong> Ticket prices include the temporary VAT reduction, with the full saving passed on to you.<br><br><em>⭐ </em><strong><em>Prison Island: The Ultimate Action Game Arrives in London</em></strong><em>! Step into Prison Island, an interactive adventure where you and your team take on 31 thrilling challenge cells. Perfect for all ages and group types—friends, families, or co-workers. Are you ready to take on the challenge?</em><br><br><strong>Highlights</strong><br> ⏱️ 60 to 120 minutes, 31 unique themed cells, one adrenaline-fueled team challenge.<br> 👥 Team up in groups of 2 to 5—perfect for families, friends &amp; co-workers<br> 🏆 Work with your team to collect as many points as possible before time runs out<br><br><strong>The perfect experience for any occasion!</strong><br> 🕵️‍♀️ <strong>Team Play</strong> – Whether with family or friends, take on the challenge together!<br> 🎂 <strong>Birthdays</strong> – From kids (ages 7+) to adults, celebrate your birthday with an unforgettable adventure. For children up to 14 years old, at least <strong>one accompanying adult is required for every group of 4 children</strong><br> 👯 <strong>Hens &amp; Stag Parties</strong>&nbsp;– Turn your celebration into an epic challenge! <strong><em>The bride or groom plays for free</em></strong>!<br> 💼 <strong>Team Building</strong> – Strengthen collaboration and problem-solving skills with an exciting group challenge. Perfect for companies and large teams! Learn more &amp; book your event here: <a href=\"https://prisonislandexperience.com/london/#london-groups\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Prison Island London – Group Experiences</a><br> 🎁 Gift memories to someone special! Purchase a gift card for Prison Island London <a href=\"https://feverup.com/m/481077\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br><br><strong>General Info</strong><br> 📅 Dates and times: select your date &amp; time directly in the ticket selector<br> ⏳ Duration: 60-120 minutes – <strong>please arrive 20 minutes before your allocated start time</strong>. Most teams won’t complete every cell; aim to score as many points as possible before time runs out!<br> 📍 Location: 5-7 Hornsey Street, London N7 8GA, UK<br> 👤 Age requirement: 7+. For teams without adults (18+), all members must be at least 14 to participate<br> ✅ All attending the experience must sign a safety waiver - this will be completed upon arrival.<br> ♿ Accessibility: Although the venue is wheelchair accessible, the layout and nature of certain challenges make the experience unsuitable for individuals with mobility impairments.<br> ❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience <a href=\"https://prisonislandexperience.com/london/#faqs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br><br><strong>Description</strong><br> Dive into 60 to 120 minutes of heart-pounding fun and an unforgettable group experience at Prison Island London! This interactive adventure combines the excitement of escape rooms with a series of physical and mental challenges. Instead of escaping from one room, teams of 2 to 5 players move through a variety of themed challenge cells, each testing different skills — from agility and coordination to logic and teamwork — as you race against the clock to earn points. There are 31 unique cells inside the prison, but you won’t have time to complete them all in one visit. The goal is to tackle as many as you can and score the highest points before time runs out — every team’s route and strategy will be different! Are you ready to take on the challenge? Let’s find out… Get your tickets today for Prison Island London!<br>",
